WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.397 --> 00:00:03.803
Unit six. Critical Thinking and Debate!

2
00:00:04.788 --> 00:00:10.285
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:10.335 --> 00:00:13.925
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.975 --> 00:00:18.727
Today we learn: Critical Thinking and Debate. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.413 --> 00:00:22.963
Argument. Say it with me. Argument!

6
00:00:26.481 --> 00:00:30.231
Evidence. Say it with me. Evidence!

7
00:00:33.726 --> 00:00:37.909
Perspective. Say it with me. Perspective!

8
00:00:41.392 --> 00:00:45.475
Persuade. Say it with me. Persuade!

9
00:00:48.978 --> 00:00:53.195
Counterargument. Say it with me. Counterargument!

10
00:00:56.709 --> 00:01:00.942
Conclusion. Say it with me. Conclusion!

11
00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:08.239
Rebuttal. Say it with me. Rebuttal!

12
00:01:11.739 --> 00:01:16.672
Logical fallacy. Say it with me. Logical fallacy!

13
00:01:20.177 --> 00:01:24.027
Moderator. Say it with me. Moderator!

14
00:01:27.523 --> 00:01:32.307
Panel discussion. Say it with me. Panel discussion!

15
00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:40.324
Cross-examine. Say it with me. Cross-examine!

16
00:01:43.823 --> 00:01:47.473
Verdict. Say it with me. Verdict!

17
00:01:50.979 --> 00:02:01.425
Grammar time! Reported speech. Listen. She said that evidence was important. He argued that we should listen.

18
00:02:01.475 --> 00:02:08.539
Your turn. Say it with me. She said that evidence was important. He argued that we should listen.

19
00:02:13.231 --> 00:02:20.305
A strong argument uses evidence to persuade others. Considering the counterargument leads to a fair conclusion.

20
00:02:20.355 --> 00:02:21.667
I like this story!

21
00:02:22.421 --> 00:02:27.811
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:27.861 --> 00:02:29.142
Perspective!

23
00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:35.613
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:35.663 --> 00:02:36.813
Rebuttal!

25
00:02:37.849 --> 00:02:46.817
Think and answer. Why is it important to consider different perspectives?

26
00:02:46.867 --> 00:02:48.017
Great answer!

27
00:02:49.152 --> 00:02:51.863
This unit's value is Open-mindedness.

28
00:02:51.913 --> 00:02:53.943
I can show open-mindedness every day!

29
00:02:54.634 --> 00:02:59.593
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

30
00:02:59.643 --> 00:03:01.377
Bye-bye, friends!

